  "text": ">\nLocation:\nUltra Dage\nPrice:\nN/A (Reward from the '\nEmpowered Lich King\n' quest)\nSellback:\n0 AC\nRarity:\nChampion Rarity\nBase Level:\n30\nDescription:\nThis item does 35% more damage to all monsters and gives 25% more gold/exp/rep/cp when equipped. Being the ultimate lich king is no easy task. You need to work your way up from lich peasant, this can take a while.\nNotes:\nAlso see:\nAwakened Lich King Statue\n.\nChained Lich King Statue\n.\nDage The Evil (Monster) (1)\n.\nDage the Paragon Statue\n.\nLord of the Underworld Statue\n.\nUltimate Lich King (Temporary)\n.\nUltimate Lich King (Permanent)\n.\nUndead Lich King Statue\n.\nThanks to Didaak and masterfighter9000.\nwindow['nitroAds'].createAd('wad-aqwwiki-below-content', {\n  \"refreshTime\": 30,\n  \"renderVisibleOnly\": false,\n  \"refreshVisibleOnly\": true,\n  \"sizes\": [ [ 300, 250 ] ],\n  \"report\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"wording\": \"Report Ad\",\n    \"position\": \"bottom-right\"\n  }\n  });\n0ac\n_e\nac\narmor\ncpboost\ngendermorph\nglowingeyes\ngoldboost\nhorns\nioda-excl\nlv-locked\nmorph\nquestreward\nrepboost\nroyalty\nskeletal\nstaffbirthday\nundead\nxdmg2monsters\nxpboost",
